  "730001": {
    "Content": "不知谁画下的格子图案，似乎与泪湖那边的几块浮冰存在着对应关系。如果按照顺序踩掉那些浮冰的话，或许会发生一些神奇的事。",
    "DialogueId": 730001,
    "GUID": "01D3D5CA",
    "SpeakNpcId": 810001
  },
  "1000101": {
    "Content": "村子可能还是很危险，一定要小心。",
    "DialogueId": 1000101,
    "ExStoryInfo": "Player",
    "GUID": "0280EF12",
    "SpeakNpcId": 100001,
    "VoiceName": "voice/$Locale$/story/1001/10001/0280EF12"
  },
  "1000201": {
    "Content": "自投罗网么？简直愚钝得可爱。",
    "DialogueId": 1000201,
    "GUID": "0280FF7A",
    "SpeakNpcId": 100005,
    "VoiceName": "voice/$Locale$/story/1001/10002/0280FF7A"
  },
  "6100101": {
    "ContentTC": "篝火附近不知為何湧出一片長滿水仙花的水域。\n一個女人正低頭端詳著水面上的倒影。那倒影模糊不清，卻美麗動人，似乎連星空也沉醉其中。",
    "DialogueId": 6100101,
    "GUID": "0F455DD2",
    "NextDialogue": 6100102,
    "RougeTalkActorType": 3
  },
  "6100102": {
    "ContentTC": "「我心愛的人啊，究竟在何方？」\n「我踏遍了阿特拉西亞，在盧卡的蔚藍群島和華胥的蒼翠幽穀找尋，在伊瑟爾微風停駐的林梢找尋，在埃斯加特峽灣春天裡破碎的薄冰找尋。」",
    "DialogueId": 6100102,
    "GUID": "0F455DFC",
    "NextDialogue": 6100103,
    "RougeTalkActorType": 1,
    "SpeakNpcId": 910005,
    "SpeakNpcName": "RougeLike_Room301_Char01"
  },
  "6100103": {
    "ContentTC": "「可是我始終未曾尋得一位心愛之人。」\n「我想與我美貌相配的佳人，正被困在這艾利西安聖湖的湖水之中。」\n她徑自對著湖面的倒影喃喃自言。",
    "DialogueId": 6100103,
    "GUID": "0F455E26",
    "NextOptions": [
      6100104,
      6100106
    ],
    "RougeTalkActorType": 1,
    "SpeakNpcId": 910005,
    "SpeakNpcName": "RougeLike_Room301_Char01"
  },
  "6100104": {
    "ContentTC": "「那只是你的倒影而已。」",
    "DialogueId": 6100104,
    "GUID": "0F455E50",
    "IsKeyOption": true,
    "NextDialogue": 6100105,
    "RougeTalkActorType": 2,
    "SpeakNpcId": 910004
  },
  "6100105": {
    "ContentTC": "「你是誰？路過的旅人嗎？」\n她抬頭，輕輕瞥了你一眼。\n「若你能找到解救她的辦法，再來見我吧。」",
    "DialogueId": 6100105,
    "GUID": "0F455E7A",
    "RougeTalkActorType": 1,
    "SpeakNpcId": 910005,
    "SpeakNpcName": "RougeLike_Room301_Char01"
  },
  "6100106": {
    "ContentTC": "嚐試摘取湖中的水仙花。",
    "DialogueId": 6100106,
    "GUID": "0F455EA4",
    "IsKeyOption": true,
    "RougeTalkActorType": 2,
    "SpeakNpcId": 910004
  },
  "6100201": {
    "ContentTC": "不遠處，孤獨的老人在小山般的武器堆旁不斷揮舞著鐵錘。\n鐵錘敲擊一次，萬物沉寂。\n鐵錘敲擊兩次，火光迸發。\n你走近，老人卻沒有抬頭。",
    "DialogueId": 6100201,
    "GUID": "0F456E3A",
    "NextDialogue": 6100202,
    "RougeTalkActorType": 3
  },
  "6100202": {
    "ContentTC": "「又一個送死的。\n「現在是哪一年？」",
    "DialogueId": 6100202,
    "GUID": "0F456E64",
    "NextOptions": [
      6100203
    ],
    "RougeTalkActorType": 1,
    "SpeakNpcId": 910005,
    "SpeakNpcName": "RougeLike_Room302_Char01"
  },
  "6100203": {
    "ContentTC": "嚐試回答。",
    "DialogueId": 6100203,
    "GUID": "0F456E8E",
    "NextDialogue": 6100204,
    "RougeTalkActorType": 2,
    "SpeakNpcId": 910004
  },
  "6100204": {
    "ContentTC": "你張了張嘴，試圖吐出一個答案。但是——\n現在是哪年……現在應當是哪一年？\n漫長的黑暗中，你早已丟失了測繪時間的尺規。",
    "DialogueId": 6100204,
    "GUID": "0F456EB8",
    "NextDialogue": 6100206,
    "RougeTalkActorType": 3
  },
  "6100206": {
    "ContentTC": "他沒能等到你的回答。",
    "DialogueId": 6100206,
    "GUID": "0F456F0C",
    "NextDialogue": 6100207,
    "RougeTalkActorType": 3
  },
  "6100207": {
    "ContentTC": "「看來你也一樣。」他歎了一口氣。\n「我不知道在這兒困了多久，早就什麼也記不得，什麼也抓不到了——除了臉上的皺紋和這把鐵錘。」",
    "DialogueId": 6100207,
    "GUID": "0F456F36",
    "NextDialogue": 6100208,
    "RougeTalkActorType": 1,
    "SpeakNpcId": 910005,
    "SpeakNpcName": "RougeLike_Room302_Char01"
  },
  "6100208": {
    "ContentTC": "「趁著火還沒滅……說吧，你想要些什麼。」",
    "DialogueId": 6100208,
    "GUID": "0F456F60",
    "NextOptions": [
      6100209,
      6100210
    ],
    "RougeTalkActorType": 1,
    "SpeakNpcId": 910005,
    "SpeakNpcName": "RougeLike_Room302_Char01"
  },
  "6100209": {
    "ContentTC": "想要從武器堆中挑選一件。",
    "DialogueId": 6100209,
    "GUID": "0F456F8A",
    "IsKeyOption": true,
    "RougeTalkActorType": 2,
    "SpeakNpcId": 910004
  },
  "6100210": {
    "ContentTC": "想要請他打造一件武器。",
    "DialogueId": 6100210,
    "GUID": "0F456FB4",
    "IsKeyOption": true,
    "RougeTalkActorType": 2,
    "SpeakNpcId": 910004
  },
  "6100301": {
    "ContentTC": "歌聲在寂寥的篝火畔響起。\n一個女人緩步走來。她步履如羽毛般輕，聲音卻如啼鳥般悠揚——",
    "DialogueId": 6100301,
    "GUID": "0F457EA2",
    "NextDialogue": 6100302,
    "RougeTalkActorType": 3
  },
  "6100302": {
    "ContentTC": "沉沉的睡意湧了上來。\n你眼前的黑暗如紙一般被揉皺，浸濕在水裡。\n……",
    "DialogueId": 6100302,
    "GUID": "0F457ECC",
    "NextDialogue": 6100303,
    "RougeTalkActorType": 3
  },
  "6100303": {
    "ContentTC": "你徜徉在午後的林泉。\n流水在絨毯般的草地間作響，陽光從繁茂的葉片擠出縫來，束束傾灑。\n安靜啜飲晨露的雪白鼯鼠，海藍山貓和淺黃野兔，並不會因腳步聲驚懼……",
    "DialogueId": 6100303,
    "GUID": "0F457EF6",
    "NextOptions": [
      6100304,
      6100306
    ],
    "RougeTalkActorType": 3
  },
  "6100304": {
    "ContentTC": "接取一滴露水。",
    "DialogueId": 6100304,
    "GUID": "0F457F20",
    "IsKeyOption": true,
    "NextDialogue": 6100305,
    "RougeTalkActorType": 2,
    "SpeakNpcId": 910004
  },
  "6100305": {
    "ContentTC": "你坐在黃昏的小酒館。\n吟遊詩人拉起風琴，歸航的水手打起拍子合唱。\n和著鹹澀的晚風與香甜的麥芽酒，你走到熱鬧的人群中央，跳起一支歡欣的舞……",
    "DialogueId": 6100305,
    "GUID": "0F457F4A",
    "NextDialogue": 6100308,
    "RougeTalkActorType": 3
  },
  "6100306": {
    "ContentTC": "擁抱一束陽光。",
    "DialogueId": 6100306,
    "GUID": "0F457F74",
    "IsKeyOption": true,
    "NextDialogue": 6100307,
    "RougeTalkActorType": 2,
    "SpeakNpcId": 910004
  },
  "6100307": {
    "ContentTC": "你匍匐在聖堂的玻璃窗下。\n巨大繪像上的白衣女神慈悲地俯瞰著你，高大、寂靜而悲傷。\n滿月的神明自斑斕的彩色馬賽克走下，她親吻你的額頭，冰涼的珠冠落在你的臉頰……",
    "DialogueId": 6100307,
    "GUID": "0F457F9E",
    "NextDialogue": 6100308,
    "RougeTalkActorType": 3
  },
  "6100308": {
    "ContentTC": "咚！\n有人彈了一下你的額頭，疼痛讓你驟然驚醒。",
    "DialogueId": 6100308,
    "GUID": "0F457FC8",
    "NextDialogue": 6100309,
    "RougeTalkActorType": 3
  },
  "6100309": {
    "ContentTC": "「我可是艾利西安最優秀的織夢師！我辛辛苦苦地編織著美夢，你卻躺在那裡睡大覺，甚至一個銅幣都沒給過我！」",
    "DialogueId": 6100309,
    "GUID": "0F457FF2",
    "NextDialogue": 6100310,
    "RougeTalkActorType": 1,
    "SpeakNpcId": 910005,
    "SpeakNpcName": "RougeLike_Room303_Char01"
  },
  "6100310": {
    "ContentTC": "「給我起來！不許睡了！」\n她氣急敗壞，又在你的腦門彈了一記。",
    "DialogueId": 6100310,
    "GUID": "0F45801C",
    "RougeTalkActorType": 1,
    "SpeakNpcId": 910005,
    "SpeakNpcName": "RougeLike_Room303_Char01"
  },
  "6100401": {
    "ContentTC": "一位老者走到篝火旁。你留意到，他手中提著一盞燈。",
    "DialogueId": 6100401,
    "GUID": "0F458F0A",
    "NextDialogue": 6100402,
    "RougeTalkActorType": 3
  },
  "6100402": {
    "ContentTC": "「讓我看看……哦！原來您也有一盞燈！」\n「不過，所有燈終究會熄滅的。您知道，若是在深淵中沒有燈火照耀，就會永遠迷失在黑暗裡。」",
    "DialogueId": 6100402,
    "GUID": "0F458F34",
    "NextDialogue": 6100403,
    "RougeTalkActorType": 1,
    "SpeakNpcId": 910005,
    "SpeakNpcName": "RougeLike_Room304_Char01"
  },
  "6100403": {
    "ContentTC": "「再買一盞燈以備不時之需吧。小小的光芒，也許能在後續的旅途中救下您的性命。」",
    "DialogueId": 6100403,
    "GUID": "0F458F5E",
    "NextOptions": [
      6100404,
      6100406,
      6100408
    ],
    "RougeTalkActorType": 1,
    "SpeakNpcId": 910005,
    "SpeakNpcName": "RougeLike_Room304_Char01"
  },
  "6100404": {
    "ContentTC": "買下提燈。",
    "DialogueId": 6100404,
    "GUID": "0F458F88",
    "IsKeyOption": true,
    "NextDialogue": 6100405,
    "RougeTalkActorType": 2,
    "SpeakNpcId": 910004
  },
  "6100405": {
    "ContentTC": "「哦……您真是一位慷慨的旅者！願群星之神的祝福與您同在。」\n他眉開眼笑，臉上的每一道溝壑都展開著。",
    "DialogueId": 6100405,
    "GUID": "0F458FB2",
    "RougeTalkActorType": 1,
    "SpeakNpcId": 910005,
    "SpeakNpcName": "RougeLike_Room304_Char01"
  },
  "6100406": {
    "ContentTC": "詢問是否有其他有用的物件。",
    "DialogueId": 6100406,
    "GUID": "0F458FDC",
    "IsKeyOption": true,
    "NextDialogue": 6100407,
    "RougeTalkActorType": 2,
    "SpeakNpcId": 910004
  },
  "6100407": {
    "ContentTC": "「哦……您真是一位慷慨的旅者！願群星之神的祝福與您同在。」\n他眉開眼笑，臉上的每一道溝壑都展開著。",
    "DialogueId": 6100407,
    "GUID": "0F459006",
    "RougeTalkActorType": 1,
    "SpeakNpcId": 910005,
    "SpeakNpcName": "RougeLike_Room304_Char01"
  },
  "6100408": {
    "ContentTC": "謝絕交易。",
    "DialogueId": 6100408,
    "GUID": "0F459030",
    "IsKeyOption": true,
    "NextDialogue": 6100409,
    "RougeTalkActorType": 2,
    "SpeakNpcId": 910004
  },
  "6100409": {
    "ContentTC": "「哦……天呐，願繁榮之神賜福於您，這樣您就不會如此窮困潦倒，竟為這一點點小錢，連身家性命都不顧了。」\n他滿腹牢騷地離開了。",
    "DialogueId": 6100409,
    "GUID": "0F45905A",
    "RougeTalkActorType": 1,
    "SpeakNpcId": 910005,
    "SpeakNpcName": "RougeLike_Room304_Char01"
  },
  "6100501": {
    "ContentTC": "「迷途的遊子啊，諸神將為你指引方向。」",
    "DialogueId": 6100501,
    "GUID": "0F459F72",
    "NextDialogue": 6100502,
    "RougeTalkActorType": 1,
    "SpeakNpcId": 910005,
    "SpeakNpcName": "RougeLike_Room305_Char01"
  },
  "6100502": {
    "ContentTC": "孩童的合唱在你腦海中驀然響起，篝火微弱的光亮逐漸溶解在一片更大的光明之中，你感到身體變得輕盈起來。\n你飄浮在空中，被一千道輕柔的風吹拂，潔白的雲朵觸手可及，神聖的金色高塔自雲層的縫隙間向你發出莊嚴的邀請。",
    "DialogueId": 6100502,
    "GUID": "0F459F9C",
    "NextDialogue": 6100503,
    "RougeTalkActorType": 3
  },
  "6100503": {
    "ContentTC": "「來吧，接受諸神的恩典，升入雲彩之上的天空。塵世已不足留戀，無上的幸福等待著你。」",
    "DialogueId": 6100503,
    "GUID": "0F459FC6",
    "NextOptions": [
      6100504,
      6100506,
      6100508
    ],
    "RougeTalkActorType": 1,
    "SpeakNpcId": 910005,
    "SpeakNpcName": "RougeLike_Room305_Char01"
  },
  "6100504": {
    "ContentTC": "留在地上。",
    "DialogueId": 6100504,
    "GUID": "0F459FF0",
    "IsKeyOption": true,
    "NextDialogue": 6100505,
    "RougeTalkActorType": 2,
    "SpeakNpcId": 910004
  },
  "6100505": {
    "ContentTC": "你知道，從天而降的幸福背後必然標著相應的價碼。\n比起空幻無依的天堂之路，你更願意相信自己留下的每一個腳步。",
    "DialogueId": 6100505,
    "GUID": "0F45A01A",
    "RougeTalkActorType": 3
  },
  "6100506": {
    "ContentTC": "接受恩典。",
    "DialogueId": 6100506,
    "GUID": "0F45A044",
    "IsKeyOption": true,
    "NextDialogue": 6100507,
    "RougeTalkActorType": 2,
    "SpeakNpcId": 910004
  },
  "6100507": {
    "ContentTC": "雲朵將你擁入懷抱，溫柔一如母親的愛撫。\n金色的大門緩緩敞開，你似乎窺見神明的掠影從門後一閃而過。雲朵散去，你回到了地面上。",
    "DialogueId": 6100507,
    "GUID": "0F45A06E",
    "NextDialogue": 6100510,
    "RougeTalkActorType": 3
  },
  "6100508": {
    "ContentTC": "嚐試抓住一片雲彩。",
    "DialogueId": 6100508,
    "GUID": "0F45A098",
    "IsKeyOption": true,
    "NextDialogue": 6100509,
    "RougeTalkActorType": 2,
    "SpeakNpcId": 910004
  },
  "6100509": {
    "ContentTC": "你向著天空用力伸手，那看似柔軟的雲朵卻如火焰一般灼傷了你的手指。\n光明消失了，耳邊傳來呼嘯的風聲，你意識到自己正在下墜。",
    "DialogueId": 6100509,
    "GUID": "0F45A0C2",
    "NextDialogue": 6100510,
    "RougeTalkActorType": 3
  },
  "6100510": {
    "ContentTC": "是啊，你忘記了——深淵之中並不存在天空。",
    "DialogueId": 6100510,
    "GUID": "0F45A0EC",
    "RougeTalkActorType": 3
  },
  "6100601": {
    "ContentTC": "一個瘦小的身影走來。\n她走近了，那是一個個頭不高的女孩兒。",
    "DialogueId": 6100601,
    "GUID": "0F45AFDA",
    "NextDialogue": 6100602,
    "RougeTalkActorType": 3
  },
  "6100602": {
    "ContentTC": "「請問……我可以……在這裡……烤一下火嗎？」\n她瑟縮著。你看到水珠從她的裙擺滴滴滾落——她的連衣裙濕透了。",
    "DialogueId": 6100602,
    "GUID": "0F45B004",
    "NextDialogue": 6100603,
    "RougeTalkActorType": 1,
    "SpeakNpcId": 910005,
    "SpeakNpcName": "RougeLike_Room306_Char01"
  },
  "6100603": {
    "ContentTC": "「我和媽媽走散了……好冷……請讓我烤一會兒火吧！一會兒……就好……」",
    "DialogueId": 6100603,
    "GUID": "0F45B02E",
    "NextOptions": [
      6100604,
      6100613
    ],
    "RougeTalkActorType": 1,
    "SpeakNpcId": 910005,
    "SpeakNpcName": "RougeLike_Room306_Char01"
  },
  "6100604": {
    "ContentTC": "同意。",
    "DialogueId": 6100604,
    "GUID": "0F45B058",
    "IsKeyOption": true,
    "NextDialogue": 6100605,
    "RougeTalkActorType": 2,
    "SpeakNpcId": 910004
  },
  "6100605": {
    "ContentTC": "「謝謝您。」\n她顫抖著，從齒隙中擠出謝意。",
    "DialogueId": 6100605,
    "GUID": "0F45B082",
    "NextDialogue": 6100606,
    "RougeTalkActorType": 1,
    "SpeakNpcId": 910005,
    "SpeakNpcName": "RougeLike_Room306_Char01"
  },
  "6100606": {
    "ContentTC": "詢問她為什麼會在這裡。",
    "DialogueId": 6100606,
    "GUID": "0F45B0AC",
    "NextDialogue": 6100607,
    "RougeTalkActorType": 2,
    "SpeakNpcId": 910004
  },
  "6100607": {
    "ContentTC": "「為……為什麼……啊……我……我想起來了……」\n「爸爸……媽媽……是……海伯利亞人……我們……逃了出來……想到……艾利西安去……」\n「在海上……船……掉進……黑色的漩渦……」",
    "DialogueId": 6100607,
    "GUID": "0F45B0D6",
    "NextDialogue": 6100608,
    "RougeTalkActorType": 1,
    "SpeakNpcId": 910005,
    "SpeakNpcName": "RougeLike_Room306_Char01"
  },
  "6100608": {
    "ContentTC": "黑色的漩渦——你知道，那是黑潮，是饑腸轆轆的深淵將一切有形之物吞入腹中。",
    "DialogueId": 6100608,
    "GUID": "0F45B100",
    "NextDialogue": 6100609,
    "RougeTalkActorType": 3
  },
  "6100609": {
    "ContentTC": "詢問她為什麼要冒險去艾利西安。",
    "DialogueId": 6100609,
    "GUID": "0F45B12A",
    "NextDialogue": 6100610,
    "RougeTalkActorType": 2,
    "SpeakNpcId": 910004
  },
  "6100610": {
    "ContentTC": "「媽媽說……我們是『惡魔的孩子』……」\n「哪怕是掉進深淵這樣最壞最壞的事……也好過……留在海伯利亞……」",
    "DialogueId": 6100610,
    "GUID": "0F45B154",
    "NextDialogue": 6100611,
    "RougeTalkActorType": 1,
    "SpeakNpcId": 910005,
    "SpeakNpcName": "RougeLike_Room306_Char01"
  },
  "6100611": {
    "ContentTC": "「謝謝您的篝火……也謝謝您告訴我……我已經不在人世了。」",
    "DialogueId": 6100611,
    "GUID": "0F45B17E",
    "NextDialogue": 6100612,
    "RougeTalkActorType": 1,
    "SpeakNpcId": 910005,
    "SpeakNpcName": "RougeLike_Room306_Char01"
  },
  "6100612": {
    "ContentTC": "她消失了。你身邊只剩下畢畢剝剝的篝火，就像從未有人來過。",
    "DialogueId": 6100612,
    "GUID": "0F45B1A8",
    "RougeTalkActorType": 3
  },
  "6100613": {
    "ContentTC": "拒絕。",
    "DialogueId": 6100613,
    "GUID": "0F45B1D2",
    "IsKeyOption": true,
    "NextDialogue": 6100614,
    "RougeTalkActorType": 2,
    "SpeakNpcId": 910004
  },
  "6100614": {
    "ContentTC": "「對……對不起……我不該打擾您的。」",
    "DialogueId": 6100614,
    "GUID": "0F45B1FC",
    "NextDialogue": 6100615,
    "RougeTalkActorType": 1,
    "SpeakNpcId": 910005,
    "SpeakNpcName": "RougeLike_Room306_Char01"
  },
  "6100615": {
    "ContentTC": "女孩顫抖著走開。你身邊只剩下畢畢剝剝的篝火，就像從未有人來過。",
    "DialogueId": 6100615,
    "GUID": "0F45B226",
    "RougeTalkActorType": 3
  },
  "6100701": {
    "ContentTC": "「你好！」",
    "DialogueId": 6100701,
    "GUID": "0F45C042",
    "NextDialogue": 6100702,
    "RougeTalkActorType": 1,
    "SpeakNpcId": 910005,
    "SpeakNpcName": "RougeLike_Room307_Char01"
  },
  "6100702": {
    "ContentTC": "背著行囊的爽朗青年走到篝火旁，大聲打了個招呼。",
    "DialogueId": 6100702,
    "GUID": "0F45C06C",
    "NextDialogue": 6100703,
    "RougeTalkActorType": 3
  },
  "6100703": {
    "ContentTC": "「可能有些失禮——但是，你還活著！對吧？」",
    "DialogueId": 6100703,
    "GUID": "0F45C096",
    "NextOptions": [
      6100704,
      6100711
    ],
    "RougeTalkActorType": 1,
    "SpeakNpcId": 910005,
    "SpeakNpcName": "RougeLike_Room307_Char01"
  },
  "6100704": {
    "ContentTC": "向他點頭致意。",
    "DialogueId": 6100704,
    "GUID": "0F45C0C0",
    "IsKeyOption": true,
    "NextDialogue": 6100705,
    "RougeTalkActorType": 2,
    "SpeakNpcId": 910004
  },
  "6100705": {
    "ContentTC": "「真沒想到還能在這兒碰見活人。看來你和我一樣，也是百裡挑一的幸運兒！」",
    "DialogueId": 6100705,
    "GUID": "0F45C0EA",
    "NextDialogue": 6100706,
    "RougeTalkActorType": 1,
    "SpeakNpcId": 910005,
    "SpeakNpcName": "RougeLike_Room307_Char01"
  },
  "6100706": {
    "ContentTC": "「我十六歲那年和老爹合寫了一首歌謠，被聖裁所判決瀆神。」\n「我本應像倒黴老爹一樣被處死，卻因為劊子手在處刑日被雷劈中得到赦免。」",
    "DialogueId": 6100706,
    "GUID": "0F45C114",
    "NextDialogue": 6100707,
    "RougeTalkActorType": 1,
    "SpeakNpcId": 910005,
    "SpeakNpcName": "RougeLike_Room307_Char01"
  },
  "6100707": {
    "ContentTC": "「二十歲那年我加入了一群遊商，在北方森林遭遇洗劫。我們被綁起來，丟在山洞裡。」\n「我以為自己會和同伴一樣餓死。但第七天的清晨，一頭豬把我拱醒，一個女孩給了我食物。我想我見到了天使。」",
    "DialogueId": 6100707,
    "GUID": "0F45C13E",
    "NextDialogue": 6100708,
    "RougeTalkActorType": 1,
    "SpeakNpcId": 910005,
    "SpeakNpcName": "RougeLike_Room307_Char01"
  },
  "6100708": {
    "ContentTC": "「再後來我作為商人跟隨騎士團來了深淵。他們手裡的燈光一盞盞熄滅，一位騎士老爺摔倒的時候被自己的劍刺穿了喉嚨。而我成為了唯一的生還者。」\n「於是我開始相信，我被命運女神所眷顧。她將賜予我無上的幸運與幸福。」",
    "DialogueId": 6100708,
    "GUID": "0F45C168",
    "NextDialogue": 6100709,
    "RougeTalkActorType": 1,
    "SpeakNpcId": 910005,
    "SpeakNpcName": "RougeLike_Room307_Char01"
  },
  "6100709": {
    "ContentTC": "「她指引我來此便意味著，這深處一定有獨一無二的至寶等待著我。現在，我該動身去尋找它了。」\n他背起沉重的行囊。",
    "DialogueId": 6100709,
    "GUID": "0F45C192",
    "NextDialogue": 6100710,
    "RougeTalkActorType": 1,
    "SpeakNpcId": 910005,
    "SpeakNpcName": "RougeLike_Room307_Char01"
  },
  "6100710": {
    "ContentTC": "「對了，朋友！既然她也讓你活了下來，那麼你一定會遇到屬於你的，獨一無二的好事！」\n他握緊雙拳，大笑了起來。\n「為了我們的幸運！」",
    "DialogueId": 6100710,
    "GUID": "0F45C1BC",
    "RougeTalkActorType": 1,
    "SpeakNpcId": 910005,
    "SpeakNpcName": "RougeLike_Room307_Char01"
  },
  "6100711": {
    "ContentTC": "躺下裝死。",
    "DialogueId": 6100711,
    "GUID": "0F45C1E6",
    "IsKeyOption": true,
    "NextDialogue": 6100712,
    "RougeTalkActorType": 2,
    "SpeakNpcId": 910004
  },
  "6100712": {
    "ContentTC": "「昏倒了？」\n他蹲了下來，試探了一下你的鼻息。\n「該不會，你也和它們一樣——是亡靈？」",
    "DialogueId": 6100712,
    "GUID": "0F45C210",
    "NextDialogue": 6100713,
    "RougeTalkActorType": 1,
    "SpeakNpcId": 910005,
    "SpeakNpcName": "RougeLike_Room307_Char01"
  },
  "6100713": {
    "ContentTC": "你沉默無言。\n他放下行囊，掏出水和食物。",
    "DialogueId": 6100713,
    "GUID": "0F45C23A",
    "NextDialogue": 6100714,
    "RougeTalkActorType": 3
  },
  "6100714": {
    "ContentTC": "「這些留給你吧，可憐的朋友！願第一縷日光照射聖塔的時候，你就會醒來，健康如初。」",
    "DialogueId": 6100714,
    "GUID": "0F45C264",
    "RougeTalkActorType": 1,
    "SpeakNpcId": 910005,
    "SpeakNpcName": "RougeLike_Room307_Char01"
  },
  "6100801": {
    "ContentTC": "一對並蒂而生的殷紅花朵在黑暗中散發著幽幽光芒。\n你舉起手中的提燈，燈光映出幾縷泛白的金發、幾節蒼白的脊骨——這是一隻人形的穢獸，還是一個即將化為穢獸的人？\n你警惕地握緊了武器，然而它卻並沒有向你發起攻擊，隻是用那雙嵌在漆黑底色裡的殷紅眼瞳無聲地注視著你。",
    "DialogueId": 6100801,
    "GUID": "0F45D0AA",
    "NextDialogue": 6100802,
    "RougeTalkActorType": 3
  },
  "6100802": {
    "ContentTC": "忽然，它的喉嚨中發出了支離破碎的聲響，如同尖銳的石塊互相摩擦產生的噪音，又似乎遵循著某種節奏。不知為何，你能夠理解其中的含義——",
    "DialogueId": 6100802,
    "GUID": "0F45D0D4",
    "NextDialogue": 6100803,
    "RougeTalkActorType": 3
  },
  "6100803": {
    "ContentTC": "「請留步，手執提燈的旅人。懇求您告訴我，我在您燈下所映出的容顏，是否依舊美麗？」",
    "DialogueId": 6100803,
    "GUID": "0F45D0FE",
    "NextDialogue": 6100804,
    "RougeTalkActorType": 1,
    "SpeakNpcId": 910005,
    "SpeakNpcName": "RougeLike_Room308_Char01"
  },
  "6100804": {
    "ContentTC": "「我將發辮梳得柔軟光亮，編成秀麗的發辮。」它撫摸著腦後綻開的皮膚。\n「我將裙褶熨燙整齊，裝點上華貴閃耀的寶石。」它撫摸著深嵌體表的結晶。\n「我戴上愛人贈予的項鏈，懷想他殷切的心意。」它撫摸著頸間延伸的骨節。",
    "DialogueId": 6100804,
    "GUID": "0F45D128",
    "NextOptions": [
      6100805,
      6100808
    ],
    "RougeTalkActorType": 1,
    "SpeakNpcId": 910005,
    "SpeakNpcName": "RougeLike_Room308_Char01"
  },
  "6100805": {
    "ContentTC": "「是的，你很美麗。」",
    "DialogueId": 6100805,
    "GUID": "0F45D152",
    "IsKeyOption": true,
    "NextDialogue": 6100806,
    "RougeTalkActorType": 2,
    "SpeakNpcId": 910004
  },
  "6100806": {
    "ContentTC": "那雙紅色的眼瞳微微顫動，如風中搖曳的花瓣。",
    "DialogueId": 6100806,
    "GUID": "0F45D17C",
    "NextDialogue": 6100807,
    "RougeTalkActorType": 3
  },
  "6100807": {
    "ContentTC": "「謝謝您，善良的旅人。請收下我的謝禮。」\n「若您見到我的愛人，請告訴他，我會永遠愛著他。」",
    "DialogueId": 6100807,
    "GUID": "0F45D1A6",
    "RougeTalkActorType": 1,
    "SpeakNpcId": 910005,
    "SpeakNpcName": "RougeLike_Room308_Char01"
  },
  "6100808": {
    "ContentTC": "「你是隻可怕的怪物。」",
    "DialogueId": 6100808,
    "GUID": "0F45D1D0",
    "IsKeyOption": true,
    "NextDialogue": 6100809,
    "RougeTalkActorType": 2,
    "SpeakNpcId": 910004
  },
  "6100809": {
    "ContentTC": "那雙紅色的眼瞳被猙獰的利爪覆蓋。",
    "DialogueId": 6100809,
    "GUID": "0F45D1FA",
    "NextDialogue": 6100810,
    "RougeTalkActorType": 3
  },
  "6100810": {
    "ContentTC": "「噢——不！我不願讓愛人見到我這般醜陋的模樣。」\n「慈悲的旅人，請您給予我終結。」",
    "DialogueId": 6100810,
    "GUID": "0F45D224",
    "RougeTalkActorType": 1,
    "SpeakNpcId": 910005,
    "SpeakNpcName": "RougeLike_Room308_Char01"
  },
  "6100901": {
    "ContentTC": "「日安，陌生的旅人。」",
    "DialogueId": 6100901,
    "GUID": "0F45E112",
    "NextDialogue": 6100902,
    "RougeTalkActorType": 1,
    "SpeakNpcId": 910005,
    "SpeakNpcName": "RougeLike_Room309_Char01"
  },
  "6100902": {
    "ContentTC": "一位衣著華麗的青年於篝火搖曳的光影中停下腳步，優雅地向你行禮。",
    "DialogueId": 6100902,
    "GUID": "0F45E13C",
    "NextDialogue": 6100903,
    "RougeTalkActorType": 3
  },
  "6100903": {
    "ContentTC": "「我在尋找一位擁有紅色眼瞳的淑女，請問您是否見過她的倩影？」",
    "DialogueId": 6100903,
    "GUID": "0F45E166",
    "NextDialogue": 6100904,
    "RougeTalkActorType": 1,
    "SpeakNpcId": 910005,
    "SpeakNpcName": "RougeLike_Room309_Char01"
  },
  "6100904": {
    "ContentTC": "「她有一副世上最動聽的歌喉，連夜鶯都為之黯然失色。」\n「她有一頭柔順的金色秀發，光潔燦爛如同春日盛開的金盞花。」\n「她身著端莊華貴的連衣裙，裙擺上綴滿星辰般閃耀的寶石。」\n「她還戴著我贈予她的項鏈，殷紅的水晶神秘幽邃一如她凝視我時的雙眸。」",
    "DialogueId": 6100904,
    "GUID": "0F45E190",
    "NextDialogue": 6100905,
    "RougeTalkActorType": 1,
    "SpeakNpcId": 910005,
    "SpeakNpcName": "RougeLike_Room309_Char01"
  },
  "6100905": {
    "ContentTC": "你並未見過這樣的女性。",
    "DialogueId": 6100905,
    "GUID": "0F45E1BA",
    "NextDialogue": 6100906,
    "RougeTalkActorType": 2,
    "SpeakNpcId": 910004
  },
  "6100906": {
    "ContentTC": "「是嗎……」\n他黯然垂眸，但很快又恢復優雅的神態，\n「無妨，我會繼續尋找。」",
    "DialogueId": 6100906,
    "GUID": "0F45E1E4",
    "NextDialogue": 6100907,
    "RougeTalkActorType": 1,
    "SpeakNpcId": 910005,
    "SpeakNpcName": "RougeLike_Room309_Char01"
  },
  "6100907": {
    "ContentTC": "青年在篝火旁坐下，明亮的火焰映在他清澈的眼眸中。",
    "DialogueId": 6100907,
    "GUID": "0F45E20E",
    "NextDialogue": 6100908,
    "RougeTalkActorType": 3
  },
  "6100908": {
    "ContentTC": "「我與她早已定下婚約，待她成年之後就將舉辦婚禮。奈何她承蒙神恩，額前的聖痕日漸顯明，於十四歲前夜被使者接走。」\n「她走前留下一封訣別信，讓我另尋佳人。可我早就立下誓言，此生只願與她一同度過。」\n「等我找到她，便要將她帶回人世。滿月之神教世人歌頌愛情之美，一定願意成全我們。」",
    "DialogueId": 6100908,
    "GUID": "0F45E238",
    "NextOptions": [
      6100909,
      6100911
    ],
    "RougeTalkActorType": 1,
    "SpeakNpcId": 910005,
    "SpeakNpcName": "RougeLike_Room309_Char01"
  },
  "6100909": {
    "ContentTC": "祝他早日尋到愛人。",
    "DialogueId": 6100909,
    "GUID": "0F45E262",
    "IsKeyOption": true,
    "NextDialogue": 6100910,
    "RougeTalkActorType": 2,
    "SpeakNpcId": 910004
  },
  "6100910": {
    "ContentTC": "「感謝您，善良的旅人。」\n「請收下這份薄禮，願您也能得到心中所求。」",
    "DialogueId": 6100910,
    "GUID": "0F45E28C",
    "RougeTalkActorType": 1,
    "SpeakNpcId": 910005,
    "SpeakNpcName": "RougeLike_Room309_Char01"
  },
  "6100911": {
    "ContentTC": "「如果神不同意呢？」",
    "DialogueId": 6100911,
    "GUID": "0F45E2B6",
    "IsKeyOption": true,
    "NextDialogue": 6100912,
    "RougeTalkActorType": 2,
    "SpeakNpcId": 910004
  },
  "6100912": {
    "ContentTC": "他向你淡淡一笑。\n「那我便將此身獻給聖湖，使我的靈魂永遠與她同在。」",
    "DialogueId": 6100912,
    "GUID": "0F45E2E0",
    "RougeTalkActorType": 1,
    "SpeakNpcId": 910005,
    "SpeakNpcName": "RougeLike_Room309_Char01"
  },
  "6101001": {
    "ContentTC": "篝火旁浮現出一個女人，她將左手伸進熊熊燃燒的篝火蘸取煙灰，於地面上書寫著你無法辨認的文字。",
    "DialogueId": 6101001,
    "GUID": "0F45F17A",
    "NextDialogue": 6101002,
    "RougeTalkActorType": 3
  },
  "6101002": {
    "ContentTC": "「啊——反抗時間的旅者，你與絕望為伴，死亡如影隨形。」\n她低聲吟詠。",
    "DialogueId": 6101002,
    "GUID": "0F45F1A4",
    "NextOptions": [
      6101003,
      6101005
    ],
    "RougeTalkActorType": 1,
    "SpeakNpcId": 910005,
    "SpeakNpcName": "RougeLike_Room310_Char01"
  },
  "6101003": {
    "ContentTC": "詢問她在做什麼。",
    "DialogueId": 6101003,
    "GUID": "0F45F1CE",
    "IsKeyOption": true,
    "NextDialogue": 6101004,
    "RougeTalkActorType": 2,
    "SpeakNpcId": 910004
  },
  "6101004": {
    "ContentTC": "「噢，親愛的朋友。如您所見，我是一位詩人。」\n「我正在創作我的第一千零一首作品——沒錯，一首為您而寫的詩！」",
    "DialogueId": 6101004,
    "GUID": "0F45F1F8",
    "NextDialogue": 6101008,
    "RougeTalkActorType": 1,
    "SpeakNpcId": 910005,
    "SpeakNpcName": "RougeLike_Room310_Char01"
  },
  "6101005": {
    "ContentTC": "「火焰不燙嗎？」",
    "DialogueId": 6101005,
    "GUID": "0F45F222",
    "IsKeyOption": true,
    "NextDialogue": 6101006,
    "RougeTalkActorType": 2,
    "SpeakNpcId": 910004
  },
  "6101006": {
    "ContentTC": "女人咯咯地笑起來。",
    "DialogueId": 6101006,
    "GUID": "0F45F24C",
    "NextDialogue": 6101007,
    "RougeTalkActorType": 3
  },
  "6101007": {
    "ContentTC": "「親愛的朋友，請看。」\n她將手掌平攤在你眼前，白皙的皮膚完好無瑕。\n「如您這般智慧的旅者，應當早就知曉這並非真實的火，我也並非真實的人。」",
    "DialogueId": 6101007,
    "GUID": "0F45F276",
    "NextDialogue": 6101008,
    "RougeTalkActorType": 1,
    "SpeakNpcId": 910005,
    "SpeakNpcName": "RougeLike_Room310_Char01"
  },
  "6101008": {
    "ContentTC": "詩人再次伸手攪動篝火，纖細的指尖在火焰中穿梭，靈動如同舞者的雙足。",
    "DialogueId": 6101008,
    "GUID": "0F45F2A0",
    "NextDialogue": 6101009,
    "RougeTalkActorType": 3
  },
  "6101009": {
    "ContentTC": "「這真是個美妙的地方，不是嗎？」\n「我終於擺脫了肉體之苦，再也不會被無聊瑣事打攪我的創作。我獲得了無上的自由，以及，永恒的時間——！」\n「旅者啊，感謝您在此駐足，為我帶來一線靈光。請收下我的詩篇，願您終能掙脫這無盡輪回，得償所願。」",
    "DialogueId": 6101009,
    "GUID": "0F45F2CA",
    "NextDialogue": 6101010,
    "RougeTalkActorType": 1,
    "SpeakNpcId": 910005,
    "SpeakNpcName": "RougeLike_Room310_Char01"
  },
  "6101010": {
    "ContentTC": "詩人向你伸手，飛揚的煙灰如風暴般瞬間侵占了你全部的視野。\n當煙灰散去，詩人早已不知所蹤。",
    "DialogueId": 6101010,
    "GUID": "0F45F2F4",
    "RougeTalkActorType": 3
  },
  "6101101": {
    "ContentTC": "「您好，請允許我借用您的火光。」",
    "DialogueId": 6101101,
    "GUID": "0F4601E2",
    "NextDialogue": 6101102,
    "RougeTalkActorType": 1,
    "SpeakNpcId": 910005,
    "SpeakNpcName": "RougeLike_Room311_Char01"
  },
  "6101102": {
    "ContentTC": "少年邁著故作正經的稚嫩步伐，緩緩在篝火邊坐下。\n他穿著一身對他而言過於寬大的禮服，襯得他那瘦小的身軀幾乎可憐。他就著火光捧起一本薄薄的書，煞有介事地朗讀起來。",
    "DialogueId": 6101102,
    "GUID": "0F46020C",
    "NextDialogue": 6101103,
    "RougeTalkActorType": 3
  },
  "6101103": {
    "ContentTC": "「火焰之神，賜予我們智慧……流水之神，賜予我們豐饒……」",
    "DialogueId": 6101103,
    "GUID": "0F460236",
    "NextOptions": [
      6101104
    ],
    "RougeTalkActorType": 1,
    "SpeakNpcId": 910005,
    "SpeakNpcName": "RougeLike_Room311_Char01"
  },
  "6101104": {
    "ContentTC": "你在讀什麼？",
    "DialogueId": 6101104,
    "GUID": "0F460260",
    "NextDialogue": 6101105,
    "RougeTalkActorType": 2,
    "SpeakNpcId": 910004
  },
  "6101105": {
    "ContentTC": "「噢，我在讀哥哥們送給我的書呢。」他羞赧地摸了摸腦袋，「我必須要在見到神明大人之前變得更加聰明才行。」\n「我從小就是家裡最笨的那個孩子，哥哥們都比我優秀得多。但是神明大人卻偏偏選中了我，大家都說這不合理。」\n「哥哥們給了我這本聖歌，囑咐我一定要在覲見九神前好好熟讀，不要給家裡丟臉。」",
    "DialogueId": 6101105,
    "GUID": "0F46028A",
    "NextDialogue": 6101106,
    "RougeTalkActorType": 1,
    "SpeakNpcId": 910005,
    "SpeakNpcName": "RougeLike_Room311_Char01"
  },
  "6101106": {
    "ContentTC": "少年挪動身體，讓自己坐得離你更近一些，隨後捧起手中的書，向你投來邀請的目光。",
    "DialogueId": 6101106,
    "GUID": "0F4602B4",
    "NextDialogue": 6101107,
    "RougeTalkActorType": 3
  },
  "6101107": {
    "ContentTC": "「你要和我一起看嗎？」",
    "DialogueId": 6101107,
    "GUID": "0F4602DE",
    "NextOptions": [
      6101108,
      6101112
    ],
    "RougeTalkActorType": 1,
    "SpeakNpcId": 910005,
    "SpeakNpcName": "RougeLike_Room311_Char01"
  },
  "6101108": {
    "ContentTC": "和他一起看書。",
    "DialogueId": 6101108,
    "GUID": "0F460308",
    "IsKeyOption": true,
    "NextDialogue": 6101109,
    "RougeTalkActorType": 2,
    "SpeakNpcId": 910004
  },
  "6101109": {
    "ContentTC": "你接受了邀請，將目光移過去。你驚訝地發現，有什麼人用漆黑的筆觸在這本書上寫滿了你從未想象過的惡毒粗鄙之語。\n瞬息之間，文字化作黑色的荊棘穿出紙面瘋長，如捕獵中的毒蛇一般緊緊纏繞你的身體。你的視野越來越暗，越來越模糊。\n出於求生本能，你猛地將身體後仰，讓視線掙脫紙面。",
    "DialogueId": 6101109,
    "GUID": "0F460332",
    "NextDialogue": 6101110,
    "RougeTalkActorType": 3
  },
  "6101110": {
    "ContentTC": "「咦？你怎麼了？書上有什麼可怕的東西嗎？」\n他困惑地看向你，目光如此清澈。",
    "DialogueId": 6101110,
    "GUID": "0F46035C",
    "NextDialogue": 6101111,
    "RougeTalkActorType": 1,
    "SpeakNpcId": 910005,
    "SpeakNpcName": "RougeLike_Room311_Char01"
  },
  "6101111": {
    "ContentTC": "你張開嘴唇，卻無法發出聲音。\n黑色的荊棘將少年籠罩、吞噬，直至少年、書和荊棘都消失不見。",
    "DialogueId": 6101111,
    "GUID": "0F460386",
    "RougeTalkActorType": 3
  },
  "6101112": {
    "ContentTC": "拒絕一起看書",
    "DialogueId": 6101112,
    "GUID": "0F4603B0",
    "IsKeyOption": true,
    "NextDialogue": 6101113,
    "RougeTalkActorType": 2,
    "SpeakNpcId": 910004
  },
  "6101113": {
    "ContentTC": "你不是來這裡學習的。",
    "DialogueId": 6101113,
    "GUID": "0F4603DA",
    "NextDialogue": 6101114,
    "RougeTalkActorType": 3
  },
  "6101114": {
    "ContentTC": "「好吧，那麼，我就自己一個人看吧……」\n他將書收回自己的膝上。",
    "DialogueId": 6101114,
    "GUID": "0F460404",
    "NextDialogue": 6101115,
    "RougeTalkActorType": 1,
    "SpeakNpcId": 910005,
    "SpeakNpcName": "RougeLike_Room311_Char01"
  },
  "6101115": {
    "ContentTC": "忽然，書頁中伸出了無數扭動的黑色荊棘。\n你甚至沒有來得及驚訝，黑色的荊棘便將少年籠罩、吞噬，直至少年、書和荊棘都消失不見。",
    "DialogueId": 6101115,
    "GUID": "0F46042E",
    "RougeTalkActorType": 3
  },
  "6101201": {
    "ContentTC": "一位中年女人面色凝重地在篝火前坐下，火光並未照亮她陰沉的雙眸。",
    "DialogueId": 6101201,
    "GUID": "0F46124A",
    "NextDialogue": 6101202,
    "RougeTalkActorType": 3
  },
  "6101202": {
    "ContentTC": "「你好，陌生人。冒昧一問，這是什麼地方？」",
    "DialogueId": 6101202,
    "GUID": "0F461274",
    "NextDialogue": 6101203,
    "RougeTalkActorType": 1,
    "SpeakNpcId": 910005,
    "SpeakNpcName": "RougeLike_Room312_Char01"
  },
  "6101203": {
    "ContentTC": "回答她。",
    "DialogueId": 6101203,
    "GUID": "0F46129E",
    "NextDialogue": 6101204,
    "RougeTalkActorType": 3
  },
  "6101204": {
    "ContentTC": "「聖湖……？深淵……？」她的語氣充滿迷茫與困惑，「可我對這些詞語毫無印象……」\n她注視著自己布滿溝壑的手掌，「我忘記了自己為何而來。」",
    "DialogueId": 6101204,
    "GUID": "0F4612C8",
    "NextOptions": [
      6101205,
      6101207
    ],
    "RougeTalkActorType": 1,
    "SpeakNpcId": 910005,
    "SpeakNpcName": "RougeLike_Room312_Char01"
  },
  "6101205": {
    "ContentTC": "告知她聖湖的曆史。",
    "DialogueId": 6101205,
    "GUID": "0F4612F2",
    "IsKeyOption": true,
    "NextDialogue": 6101206,
    "RougeTalkActorType": 2,
    "SpeakNpcId": 910004
  },
  "6101206": {
    "ContentTC": "「身上出現聖痕的人……會被帶來這裡……？」\n「啊……我想起來了。我的孩子就在這裡。她的眼角出現了聖痕，就像一隻將要振翅起飛的蝴蝶。」",
    "DialogueId": 6101206,
    "GUID": "0F46131C",
    "NextDialogue": 6101210,
    "RougeTalkActorType": 1,
    "SpeakNpcId": 910005,
    "SpeakNpcName": "RougeLike_Room312_Char01"
  },
  "6101207": {
    "ContentTC": "建議她翻看隨身物品。",
    "DialogueId": 6101207,
    "GUID": "0F461346",
    "IsKeyOption": true,
    "NextDialogue": 6101208,
    "RougeTalkActorType": 2,
    "SpeakNpcId": 910004
  },
  "6101208": {
    "ContentTC": "「你說得對。」\n她將手伸進口袋，摸出了一枚銀色的胸針。",
    "DialogueId": 6101208,
    "GUID": "0F461370",
    "NextDialogue": 6101209,
    "RougeTalkActorType": 1,
    "SpeakNpcId": 910005,
    "SpeakNpcName": "RougeLike_Room312_Char01"
  },
  "6101209": {
    "ContentTC": "「啊……我想起來了。」她小心翼翼地用袖口將胸針擦拭乾淨，「這是我要送給那孩子的禮物。」",
    "DialogueId": 6101209,
    "GUID": "0F46139A",
    "NextDialogue": 6101210,
    "RougeTalkActorType": 1,
    "SpeakNpcId": 910005,
    "SpeakNpcName": "RougeLike_Room312_Char01"
  },
  "6101210": {
    "ContentTC": "女人抬起了頭，此刻，火光清晰地映在她的眼中。",
    "DialogueId": 6101210,
    "GUID": "0F4613C4",
    "NextDialogue": 6101211,
    "RougeTalkActorType": 3
  },
  "6101211": {
    "ContentTC": "「我來這裡找我的孩子。」\n「他們趁我不在家的時候，把熟睡的她帶走了。可那孩子從小就怕生，如果醒來見不到熟悉的面孔，她一定會非常害怕。」\n「我要陪著她……沒錯，我是來找她的。」",
    "DialogueId": 6101211,
    "GUID": "0F4613EE",
    "NextDialogue": 6101212,
    "RougeTalkActorType": 1,
    "SpeakNpcId": 910005,
    "SpeakNpcName": "RougeLike_Room312_Char01"
  },
  "6101212": {
    "ContentTC": "「她離開多久了？」",
    "DialogueId": 6101212,
    "GUID": "0F461418",
    "NextDialogue": 6101213,
    "RougeTalkActorType": 2,
    "SpeakNpcId": 910004
  },
  "6101213": {
    "ContentTC": "「她是十天前……不，十個月……不，十年……啊……我忘記了。」",
    "DialogueId": 6101213,
    "GUID": "0F461442",
    "NextDialogue": 6101214,
    "RougeTalkActorType": 1,
    "SpeakNpcId": 910005,
    "SpeakNpcName": "RougeLike_Room312_Char01"
  },
  "6101214": {
    "ContentTC": "女人不說話了；她陷入了一種異常的呆滯，全身一動不動，似乎連呼吸都一同停止了。\n無論你說什麼，她都再也沒有任何反應。",
    "DialogueId": 6101214,
    "GUID": "0F46146C",
    "RougeTalkActorType": 3
  },
  "6101301": {
    "ContentTC": "「嘭——」\n忽然間，眼前的篝火燒得更旺了。\n你注意到一位金發少女，她用裙擺兜著一把金黃色的小石子，伸手將它們一顆一顆地丟進篝火中央。",
    "DialogueId": 6101301,
    "GUID": "0F4622B2",
    "NextDialogue": 6101302,
    "RougeTalkActorType": 3
  },
  "6101302": {
    "ContentTC": "火焰竄得越來越高，像迎來了生命中第一個春天那般瘋狂地抽枝發芽。",
    "DialogueId": 6101302,
    "GUID": "0F4622DC",
    "NextOptions": [
      6101303,
      6101305
    ],
    "RougeTalkActorType": 3
  },
  "6101303": {
    "ContentTC": "誇讚火焰的美麗。",
    "DialogueId": 6101303,
    "GUID": "0F462306",
    "IsKeyOption": true,
    "NextDialogue": 6101304,
    "RougeTalkActorType": 2,
    "SpeakNpcId": 910004
  },
  "6101304": {
    "ContentTC": "「是啊！」她的語氣就如火焰一樣熱烈，「很高興您與我擁有相同的想法。」",
    "DialogueId": 6101304,
    "GUID": "0F462330",
    "NextDialogue": 6101307,
    "RougeTalkActorType": 1,
    "SpeakNpcId": 910005,
    "SpeakNpcName": "RougeLike_Room313_Char01"
  },
  "6101305": {
    "ContentTC": "詢問少女石頭的來曆。",
    "DialogueId": 6101305,
    "GUID": "0F46235A",
    "IsKeyOption": true,
    "NextDialogue": 6101306,
    "RougeTalkActorType": 2,
    "SpeakNpcId": 910004
  },
  "6101306": {
    "ContentTC": "「這是我在附近撿的石頭。」她解釋道，「我想它們應該是某種火焰魔法結晶。」",
    "DialogueId": 6101306,
    "GUID": "0F462384",
    "NextDialogue": 6101307,
    "RougeTalkActorType": 1,
    "SpeakNpcId": 910005,
    "SpeakNpcName": "RougeLike_Room313_Char01"
  },
  "6101307": {
    "ContentTC": "少女繼續扔著石子，不知是否是你的錯覺，火焰似乎離少女越來越近，溫柔地舔舐著她金色的發絲。",
    "DialogueId": 6101307,
    "GUID": "0F4623AE",
    "NextDialogue": 6101308,
    "RougeTalkActorType": 3
  },
  "6101308": {
    "ContentTC": "「到明天，篝火就會恢復原樣，這些小石子也會再次散落在附近。」\n「所以我每天都要把這些石子撿起來重新扔進去。一共一百四十六顆，一顆不多，一顆不少。」",
    "DialogueId": 6101308,
    "GUID": "0F4623D8",
    "NextDialogue": 6101309,
    "RougeTalkActorType": 1,
    "SpeakNpcId": 910005,
    "SpeakNpcName": "RougeLike_Room313_Char01"
  },
  "6101309": {
    "ContentTC": "「這不是毫無意義嗎？」",
    "DialogueId": 6101309,
    "GUID": "0F462402",
    "NextDialogue": 6101310,
    "RougeTalkActorType": 2,
    "SpeakNpcId": 910004
  },
  "6101310": {
    "ContentTC": "少女歪了歪頭，眨眨眼睛，露出了天真的笑容。",
    "DialogueId": 6101310,
    "GUID": "0F46242C",
    "NextDialogue": 6101311,
    "RougeTalkActorType": 3
  },
  "6101311": {
    "ContentTC": "「不，我喜歡火。」她說，「我喜歡聽它燃燒的聲音，喜歡看它躍動的身影。」\n「你知道，在這個地方，空間是混亂的。閉上眼前還在篝火邊，一醒來就到了湖水底。」\n「但是這些小石子不一樣，不管環境怎麼變化，它們總會再次出現。一想到明天還能找到它們，我就能安心地入眠。」",
    "DialogueId": 6101311,
    "GUID": "0F462456",
    "NextDialogue": 6101312,
    "RougeTalkActorType": 1,
    "SpeakNpcId": 910005,
    "SpeakNpcName": "RougeLike_Room313_Char01"
  },
  "6101312": {
    "ContentTC": "「我喜歡確定的東西。」",
    "DialogueId": 6101312,
    "GUID": "0F462480",
    "NextDialogue": 6101313,
    "RougeTalkActorType": 1,
    "SpeakNpcId": 910005,
    "SpeakNpcName": "RougeLike_Room313_Char01"
  },
  "6101313": {
    "ContentTC": "少女說著扔出了最後一顆石子。\n火光完全籠罩了她，金色的發絲與火焰融為一體，再難分辨邊界。",
    "DialogueId": 6101313,
    "GUID": "0F4624AA",
    "RougeTalkActorType": 3
  },
  "6101401": {
    "ContentTC": "「唔……呃……」",
    "DialogueId": 6101401,
    "GUID": "0F46331A",
    "NextDialogue": 6101402,
    "RougeTalkActorType": 1,
    "SpeakNpcId": 910005,
    "SpeakNpcName": "RougeLike_Room314_Char01"
  },
  "6101402": {
    "ContentTC": "虛弱的呻吟聲從低處傳來，你注意到一位瘦骨嶙峋的男人倒在篝火邊，看起來似乎餓壞了。",
    "DialogueId": 6101402,
    "GUID": "0F463344",
    "NextOptions": [
      6101403,
      6101409
    ],
    "RougeTalkActorType": 3
  },
  "6101403": {
    "ContentTC": "分給他一點食物。",
    "DialogueId": 6101403,
    "GUID": "0F46336E",
    "IsKeyOption": true,
    "NextDialogue": 6101404,
    "RougeTalkActorType": 2,
    "SpeakNpcId": 910004
  },
  "6101404": {
    "ContentTC": "「……謝謝你，好心的孩子。但我已經不需要食物了。」\n「我被黑潮卷了進來。我已經回不去了，吃再多的食物，也回不去了。」\n「你讓我想起了一個艾利西安的小姑娘……一個和你一樣善良的孩子。」",
    "DialogueId": 6101404,
    "GUID": "0F463398",
    "NextDialogue": 6101405,
    "RougeTalkActorType": 1,
    "SpeakNpcId": 910005,
    "SpeakNpcName": "RougeLike_Room314_Char01"
  },
  "6101405": {
    "ContentTC": "「她有一頭金色的頭髮，騎著一隻粉紅色的巨豬。在我饑腸轆轆地走在街頭時，她向我遞來了一片面包……」\n「可那時的我心高氣傲，不願接受傳頌會的施舍。明知小姑娘是善意，卻還大聲地咒罵了她。」",
    "DialogueId": 6101405,
    "GUID": "0F4633C2",
    "NextDialogue": 6101406,
    "RougeTalkActorType": 1,
    "SpeakNpcId": 910005,
    "SpeakNpcName": "RougeLike_Room314_Char01"
  },
  "6101406": {
    "ContentTC": "「如今，回想起我的一生……我才恍然發覺，她也許是唯一真心對待過我的人。」\n「信仰、種族、出身……人們總是用這些東西……粉飾自己……但再多的頭銜，都無法蓋過真正的善良所發出的光輝……」",
    "DialogueId": 6101406,
    "GUID": "0F4633EC",
    "NextDialogue": 6101407,
    "RougeTalkActorType": 1,
    "SpeakNpcId": 910005,
    "SpeakNpcName": "RougeLike_Room314_Char01"
  },
  "6101407": {
    "ContentTC": "「如果還能回去，我想要……親自向她道歉……只是，已經……沒機會了……」",
    "DialogueId": 6101407,
    "GUID": "0F463416",
    "NextDialogue": 6101408,
    "RougeTalkActorType": 1,
    "SpeakNpcId": 910005,
    "SpeakNpcName": "RougeLike_Room314_Char01"
  },
  "6101408": {
    "ContentTC": "男人的聲音逐漸變得越來越輕，你眨了眨眼睛，他的身影消失不見。\n空氣中飄來一縷剛出爐的面包的香氣。",
    "DialogueId": 6101408,
    "GUID": "0F463440",
    "RougeTalkActorType": 3
  },
  "6101409": {
    "ContentTC": "什麼也不做。",
    "DialogueId": 6101409,
    "GUID": "0F46346A",
    "IsKeyOption": true,
    "NextDialogue": 6101410,
    "RougeTalkActorType": 2,
    "SpeakNpcId": 910004
  },
  "6101410": {
    "ContentTC": "男人看上去確實非常可憐，但你身上的補給也已經所剩無幾。\n在這險惡的深淵中，你必須先確保自己能活下去。",
    "DialogueId": 6101410,
    "GUID": "0F463494",
    "RougeTalkActorType": 3
  },
  "6101501": {
    "ContentTC": "一道金光自空中閃現，你恍惚以為是太陽升起，定睛一看，原來那是一隻通體金黃的鳥兒。\n它從空中盤旋降落，停落在你身邊，優雅地收攏翅膀，聚起的金色羽毛在篝火的映照下熠熠生輝，比貴族少女們珍藏的金飾還要細密精巧。",
    "DialogueId": 6101501,
    "GUID": "0F464382",
    "NextOptions": [
      6101502,
      6101505,
      6101509
    ],
    "RougeTalkActorType": 3
  },
  "6101502": {
    "ContentTC": "給鳥兒喂水。",
    "DialogueId": 6101502,
    "GUID": "0F4643AC",
    "IsKeyOption": true,
    "NextDialogue": 6101503,
    "RougeTalkActorType": 2,
    "SpeakNpcId": 910004
  },
  "6101503": {
    "ContentTC": "你在掌心倒了一些清水，伸手向鳥兒發出邀請。",
    "DialogueId": 6101503,
    "GUID": "0F4643D6",
    "NextDialogue": 6101504,
    "RougeTalkActorType": 3
  },
  "6101504": {
    "ContentTC": "鳥兒歪了歪頭，警惕地觀察著你。片刻之後，它矜持地探出金色的喙，在你的掌心小口啜飲起來。\n喝完水，它愉快地扇了扇美麗的羽毛，向你發出感激的鳴叫，隨後飛上天空，盤旋而去。",
    "DialogueId": 6101504,
    "GUID": "0F464400",
    "RougeTalkActorType": 3
  },
  "6101505": {
    "ContentTC": "嚐試從鳥兒的尾部拔一根羽毛。",
    "DialogueId": 6101505,
    "GUID": "0F46442A",
    "IsKeyOption": true,
    "NextDialogue": 6101506,
    "RougeTalkActorType": 2,
    "SpeakNpcId": 910004
  },
  "6101506": {
    "ContentTC": "你悄悄伸手，趁鳥兒閉眼休息時，從它的尾巴上拔下了一根羽毛——羽毛的質地如同上等的黃金，一定價值不菲。",
    "DialogueId": 6101506,
    "GUID": "0F464454",
    "NextDialogue": 6101507,
    "RougeTalkActorType": 3
  },
  "6101507": {
    "ContentTC": "鳥兒發出一聲憤怒的鳴叫，撲扇著翅膀向你飛來。它不遺餘力的一啄如同滾燙的熔金滴落在你的掌心，留下了一道鮮明的紅色印記。",
    "DialogueId": 6101507,
    "GUID": "0F46447E",
    "NextDialogue": 6101508,
    "RougeTalkActorType": 3
  },
  "6101508": {
    "ContentTC": "待你從鑽心的痛楚中回過神來，鳥兒早已盤旋飛遠。",
    "DialogueId": 6101508,
    "GUID": "0F4644A8",
    "RougeTalkActorType": 3
  },
  "6101509": {
    "ContentTC": "嘗試從鳥兒的頭部拔一根羽毛。",
    "DialogueId": 6101509,
    "GUID": "0F4644D2",
    "IsKeyOption": true,
    "NextDialogue": 6101510,
    "RougeTalkActorType": 2,
    "SpeakNpcId": 910004
  },
  "6101510": {
    "ContentTC": "你悄悄伸手接近鳥兒的腦袋，但還沒來得及用力，它便注意到你的意圖，驀地睜開了眼睛。\n鳥兒發出一聲憤怒的鳴叫，撲扇著翅膀向你飛來。它不遺餘力的一啄如同滾燙的熔金滴落在你的掌心，留下了一道鮮明的紅色印記。",
    "DialogueId": 6101510,
    "GUID": "0F4644FC",
    "NextDialogue": 6101511,
    "RougeTalkActorType": 3
  },
  "6101511": {
    "ContentTC": "待你從鑽心的痛楚中回過神來，鳥兒早已盤旋飛遠。",
    "DialogueId": 6101511,
    "GUID": "0F464526",
    "RougeTalkActorType": 3
  },
  "6101601": {
    "ContentTC": "一股腐敗、腥穢的氣息從近處傳來。\n你看到一個小女孩出現在篝火邊。她的臉頰和手臂上都布滿了可怕的膿瘡，若不是那雙眼睛仍在篝火映照下透出生命的光芒，你幾乎要懷疑眼前所見的面是一具屍體。",
    "DialogueId": 6101601,
    "GUID": "0F4653EA",
    "NextOptions": [
      6101602,
      6101606,
      6101612
    ],
    "RougeTalkActorType": 3
  },
  "6101602": {
    "ContentTC": "你從背包中找出了一些藥品，遞給女孩。",
    "DialogueId": 6101602,
    "GUID": "0F465414",
    "IsKeyOption": true,
    "NextDialogue": 6101603,
    "RougeTalkActorType": 2,
    "SpeakNpcId": 910004
  },
  "6101603": {
    "ContentTC": "「感謝您……善良的旅人……」\n她慢慢地抬起頭看向你；你不確定她勾起的嘴角究竟是主動露出的笑容，還是因疼痛而產生的肌肉扭曲。",
    "DialogueId": 6101603,
    "GUID": "0F46543E",
    "NextDialogue": 6101604,
    "RougeTalkActorType": 1,
    "SpeakNpcId": 910005,
    "SpeakNpcName": "RougeLike_Room316_Char01"
  },
  "6101604": {
    "ContentTC": "「但是，請……不必幫助我……」她低聲說道，「司祭大人說，我染上了詛咒，得了深淵病，這是我的罪孽……」\n「我必須誠心懺悔……然後，我就會好起來的……在那之前，我不可以接近任何人。」",
    "DialogueId": 6101604,
    "GUID": "0F465468",
    "NextDialogue": 6101605,
    "RougeTalkActorType": 1,
    "SpeakNpcId": 910005,
    "SpeakNpcName": "RougeLike_Room316_Char01"
  },
  "6101605": {
    "ContentTC": "女孩搖搖晃晃地撐起身體，轉身消失在黑暗中。",
    "DialogueId": 6101605,
    "GUID": "0F465492",
    "RougeTalkActorType": 3
  },
  "6101606": {
    "ContentTC": "嚐試治療女孩的傷口。",
    "DialogueId": 6101606,
    "GUID": "0F4654BC",
    "IsKeyOption": true,
    "NextDialogue": 6101607,
    "RougeTalkActorType": 2,
    "SpeakNpcId": 910004
  },
  "6101607": {
    "ContentTC": "你小心地接近女孩，試圖查看她身上傷口的情況。",
    "DialogueId": 6101607,
    "GUID": "0F4654E6",
    "NextDialogue": 6101608,
    "RougeTalkActorType": 3
  },
  "6101608": {
    "ContentTC": "「咳、咳……！」\n她猛烈地咳嗽起來，暗紅色的血濺在你伸出的手上，升騰起不祥的黑色煙霧。",
    "DialogueId": 6101608,
    "GUID": "0F465510",
    "NextDialogue": 6101609,
    "RougeTalkActorType": 1,
    "SpeakNpcId": 910005,
    "SpeakNpcName": "RougeLike_Room316_Char01"
  },
  "6101609": {
    "ContentTC": "「對、對不起……！」\n她搖搖晃晃地撐起身體，想要退後，卻又不小心跌倒在地。",
    "DialogueId": 6101609,
    "GUID": "0F46553A",
    "NextDialogue": 6101610,
    "RougeTalkActorType": 1,
    "SpeakNpcId": 910005,
    "SpeakNpcName": "RougeLike_Room316_Char01"
  },
  "6101610": {
    "ContentTC": "「司祭大人說，我染上了詛咒，得了深淵病，這是我的罪孽……」\n「我必須誠心懺悔……然後，我就會好起來的……在那之前，我不可以接近任何人。」",
    "DialogueId": 6101610,
    "GUID": "0F465564",
    "NextDialogue": 6101611,
    "RougeTalkActorType": 1,
    "SpeakNpcId": 910005,
    "SpeakNpcName": "RougeLike_Room316_Char01"
  },
  "6101611": {
    "ContentTC": "女孩再次艱難起身，跌跌撞撞地消失在黑暗中。",
    "DialogueId": 6101611,
    "GUID": "0F46558E",
    "RougeTalkActorType": 3
  },
  "6101612": {
    "ContentTC": "遠離她。",
    "DialogueId": 6101612,
    "GUID": "0F4655B8",
    "IsKeyOption": true,
    "NextDialogue": 6101613,
    "RougeTalkActorType": 2,
    "SpeakNpcId": 910004
  },
  "6101613": {
    "ContentTC": "直覺告訴你女孩可能患有某種危險的疫病，於是你起身與她拉開了一段距離。",
    "DialogueId": 6101613,
    "GUID": "0F4655E2",
    "NextDialogue": 6101614,
    "RougeTalkActorType": 3
  },
  "6101614": {
    "ContentTC": "「抱歉……讓您受到了驚嚇……我、我這就離開……」",
    "DialogueId": 6101614,
    "GUID": "0F46560C",
    "NextDialogue": 6101615,
    "RougeTalkActorType": 1,
    "SpeakNpcId": 910005,
    "SpeakNpcName": "RougeLike_Room316_Char01"
  },
  "6101615": {
    "ContentTC": "女孩搖搖晃晃地撐起身體，轉身消失在黑暗中。",
    "DialogueId": 6101615,
    "GUID": "0F465636",
    "RougeTalkActorType": 3
  },
  "6101701": {
    "ContentTC": "你在篝火旁坐下休息，順手將提燈放在腳邊。\n就在你的手指離開提燈的瞬間，地面上忽然泛起了水光。你還來不及作出反應，提燈便被水中卷起的漩渦吞沒了。",
    "DialogueId": 6101701,
    "GUID": "0F466452",
    "NextDialogue": 6101702,
    "RougeTalkActorType": 3
  },
  "6101702": {
    "ContentTC": "一個戴著滑稽的鳥頭面具的人從水裡探出半個身體，甩了甩腦袋，然後張開了雙臂——三盞形狀相同但材質各異的提燈在水面上浮現。",
    "DialogueId": 6101702,
    "GUID": "0F46647C",
    "NextDialogue": 6101703,
    "RougeTalkActorType": 3
  }
}